'''Sage of Mind Soractes''' (論の賢者ソラクティス, ''Ron no Kenja Sorakutisu'', '''Sage of Theory Soractis''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] enemy that appears in [[Zero Legends]]. He is the enemy version of [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Soractes]]. He was added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sage of Mind Soractes
|image = E 677.png
|appearance = '''ZL''': [[Adherence to Virtue|Sub-chapter 9 - Adherence to Virtue]]
|money drop = 6,000¢ - 23,700¢
}}

==Enemy==
Soractes is one of the, if not the hardest pusher in the game. He is incredibly aggressive, rushing up to the frontline upon spawning and firing rapid attacks. While he only has 250 range, his huge DPS allows him to shred the frontline quickly, with his Omni Strike extending his reach to 430 and putting midranged backliners out of the question. This is topped off with a 30% chance to Freeze for 2 seconds, with his fast attacks giving it deadly consistency and uptime.

Soractes is also the first enemy to have the Sage type, which reduces the distance of all knockback effects and the duration of all debuffs applied to him by 70% unless they are inflicted by [[:Category:Sage Slayer Cats|Sage Slayers]], making it nearly impossible to get him off the [[Cat Base]] once he has locked onto it.

